@startuml US_3_1_3_Process
title US 3.1.3 - Menus dinâmicos por role

actor User
participant Layout as "LayoutComponent"
participant Auth as "AuthService"
participant Guard as "AuthGuard"
participant API as "TodoApi"

User -> Layout: Abre SPA
Layout -> Auth: loadUserFromLocalStorage()
Layout -> API: GET /authtest/me (if missing)
API --> Layout: {role(s)}
Layout -> API: GET /api/auth/role
API --> Layout: active roles (admin/operator/agent/authority)\n403 se não tiver role
Layout -> Layout: filter menuItems by role\n(admin vê tudo)
User -> Guard: navegar /docks
Guard -> Auth: role atual
Guard -> Guard: verificar data.roles
Guard --> User: allow or redirect + toast "Acesso negado"

@enduml
